000F04r 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
000F04r 2               ; do_if — IF condition [body]
000F04r 2               ;   Arity 0 — handles its own argument parsing
000F04r 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
000F04r 2               do_if:
000F04r 2  20 rr rr           JSR   eval_expr
