000F3Fr 2               ; do_ifelse — IFELSE condition [true-body] [false-body]
000F3Fr 2               ;   Arity 0 — handles its own argument parsing
000F3Fr 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
000F3Fr 2               do_ifelse:
000F3Fr 2  20 rr rr           JSR   eval_expr
